},\\,y=5{e}^{2t}-7$ where $t$ is a real number. Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}.$" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266522 1113 #uuid "601fce0f-444c-5aa9-8cae-681efbedd5e1" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266522 1145 "To find the first derivative, we will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=15{e}^{1+5t},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=10{e}^{2t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{10{e}^{2t}}{15{e}^{1+5t}}=\\frac{2}{3}{e}^{-1-3t}.\n$$\n\nTo compute the second derivative, we can use the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{dt}(\\frac{dy}{dx})}{(\\frac{dx}{dt})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{dt}(\\frac{2}{3}{e}^{-1-3t})}{15{e}^{1+5t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-2{e}^{-1-3t}}{15{e}^{1+5t}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{15}{e}^{-2-8t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266524 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266525 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266526 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266527 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266528 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1041 "selection" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266527 13194139533929 true] [17592186266523 1110 #uuid "1a7bf77d-b817-5bde-beb0-e863897247b9" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266524 1034 "\\frac{1}{15}{e}^{2-8t}" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266524 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533929 true] [17592186266524 1111 #uuid "776acaeb-f992-5cea-bb78-00b08fd8b407" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266525 1034 "-\\frac{15}{2}{e}^{8-2t}" 13194139533929 true] [17592186266525 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533929 t